{"id":"word:hebrew:H5038","type":"word","title":"נְבֵלָה","subtitle":"H5038 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a flabby thing, i.e. a carcase or carrion (human or bestial, often collectively); figuratively, an idol","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to נְבֵלָה (H5038) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 48 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"נְבֵלָה (nᵉbêlâh) means a flabby thing, i.e. a carcase or carrion (human or bestial, often collectively); figuratively, an idol First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 13 22."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"נְבֵלָה","transliteration":"nᵉbêlâh","pronunciation":"neb-ay-law'","strong":"H5038","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5038","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["נְבֵלָה֙","נִבְלָתָ/ם֙","בְּ/נִבְלָתָ֖/ם","נִבְלָת/וֹ֙","הַ/נְּבֵלָ֑ה"],"morphs":[["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3mp",7],["HNcfsc/Sp3ms",6],["HNcfsc/Sp3mp",6],["HTd/Ncfsa",5],["HNcfsc",5],["HNcfsa",5],["HR/Ncfsc",4],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",2],["HC/R/Ncfsc/Sp3mp",2],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3fs",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"a flabby thing, i.e. a carcase or carrion (human or bestial, often collectively); figuratively, an idol","usage":"(dead) body, (dead) carcase, dead of itself, which died, (beast) that (which) dieth of itself.","full":"H5038. nebelah נְבֵלָה noun feminine carcass, corpse (as inert, flabby ); — ׳נ absolute 1Kin 13:24 +; construct נִבְלַת 13:29 +; suffix נְבֵלָתִי Isa 26:19 ; נִבְלָֽתְךָ Deut 28:26 ; 1Kin 13:22 ; נֵבְלָתוֺ + Josh 82:9 6t.; נִבְלָתָהּ Lev 11:39-40 , (twice in verse); נִבְלָתָם Isa 5:25 14 t.; — carcass, corpse : 1. a. human (not in Ezekiel, P, (H), which use מֶּגֶר ); Josh 8:29 (JE), 1Kin 13:22 , 24 (twice in verse); 13:25 (twice in verse); 13:28 (3 t. in verse); 13:29-30 , 2Kin 9:37 ; Jer 26:23 ; 36:30 ; Deut 21:23 ; 28:26 ; collective corpses Isa 5:25 ; 26:19 (wish for restoration to life), Jer 7:33 ; 9:21 ; 16:4 ; 19:7 ; 34:20 ; Psa 79:2 . b. of lifeless idols, collective וגו שִׁקּוּצֵיהֶם ׳נִבְלַת Jer 16:18 . 2 of animals (clean and unclean, wild animals, cattle, birds and reptiles, chiefly Leviticus, Ezekiel), Deut 14:8 ; Lev 5:2 (3 t. in verse); 11:8 , 11 , 24 , 25 , 27 , 28 , 35 , 36 , 37 , 38 ; 17:15 (all P); ׳נ specifically = body of animal dying of itself Deut 14:21 ; Lev 7:24 ; 11:39-40 , (twice in verse) (P), 22:8 (H), Ezek 4:14 ; 44:31 .","rootNote":"from 5034 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 13 22","keyReferences":["1Kgs 13 22","1Kgs 13 24","1Kgs 13 24","1Kgs 13 25","1Kgs 13 25","1Kgs 13 28","1Kgs 13 28","1Kgs 13 28"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":48,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 13 22","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נִבְלָתְ/ךָ֖","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 24","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נִבְלָת/וֹ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 24","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/נְּבֵלָֽה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 25","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/נְּבֵלָה֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 25","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/נְּבֵלָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 28","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נִבְלָת/וֹ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 28","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/נְּבֵלָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 28","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/נְּבֵלָ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 29","book":"1Kgs","ch